"ail-drefnu wrth i'r wybodaeth newid. Ti'n gallu difford y trefnu awtomatig "
"trwy dde-glicio'r ar benawd y golofn, dewis 'Mwy o Opsiynau' a dad-ddewis "
"'Trefnu'n Awtomatig'."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/TipOfTheDayMessages.java:68
msgid ""
